NOT RUN, and withdrawn by dated amendment rather than omitted:
  H2's post-monsoon Sentinel-2 EOS cross-check (§2 H2, §3.4). §3.4's
  2026-09-09 amendment removed HLS as a substrate and the optical
  panel is unusable under monsoon cloud, so no Sentinel-2 EOS series
  exists for these district-seasons. H2 clause (a) is therefore
  reported on the radar orbit pair alone, with no optical second
  opinion. See analysis/deviation_log.md.
